# Go binary (at repo root only, not cmd/whatsmeow-node/ source dir)
#
# GOBERNA: el binario de la raiz SI se commitea en este fork. Es la ruta que
# resolveBinary() mira primero, y `npm ci` en el VPS no compila Go.
# /whatsmeow-node
*.exe

# Node / TypeScript
# GOBERNA: ts/dist tambien se commitea — el VPS no compila TypeScript.
# ts/dist/
ts/node_modules/
ts/*.db
ts/*.db-*
ts/coverage/

# Platform packages (populated at release time)
npm/*/bin/

# GOBERNA: cache de modulos Go que monta el build con Docker del README.
.gocache/

# Environment
.env

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
